## Naming

| Thing | Convention | Example |
|-------|-----------|---------|
| Component files | `PascalCase.jsx`, default export | `UpdateAssetsSection.jsx` |
| Stores | `camelCase.js` | `useRoadmapStore.js` |
| Utils / hooks / services | `camelCase.js` | `cloudAsset.js` |
| Constants | `SCREAMING_SNAKE` exports | `ADMIN_EMAILS` |
| Folders | lowercase | `components/admin/` |
| Prop handlers | `onVerb` | `onClose`, `onSelect` |

