## Styling Tokens

Use these Tailwind classes (defined in `@theme`):

| Token | Class |
|-------|-------|
| Primary purple | `text-brand`, `bg-brand`, `border-brand` |
| Strong purple | `bg-brand-strong` |
| Soft purple bg | `bg-brand-soft` |
| Accent pink | `text-accent-pink` |
| Dark ink | `text-ink` |
| Surface white | `bg-surface` |

Use `style={}` only for dynamic values or gradients. React Flow overrides need `!`-prefix: `!bg-green-400`.

---

## Admin Dashboard Pattern

New admin sections live in `src/components/admin/`. Follow this pattern:

```jsx
// src/components/admin/MySection.jsx
import { useToast } from './Toast'

export default function MySection() {
  const { showToast } = useToast()
  // ...
  return <div className="space-y-4">...</div>
}
```

---

## Firebase Storage Layout

| Prefix | Contents |
|--------|----------|
| `sprites/`, `ui/`, `audio/` | Sprout Lands assets (Cup Nooble) — updated by push script |
| `rc/` | Roller Coaster custom assets (MBTI sprites, maps, tilesets) |
| `maps/` | Tiled JSON map files |

`rc/` is NEVER overwritten by asset sync operations.

---

## Asset Manifest

`src/game/assetManifest.js` is the single source of truth for Phaser asset keys → Storage paths.
When adding new RC assets, add an entry here. Keep it pure data — no Firebase SDK imports.

---

## Precautions

- **Store mutations auto-sync.** Zustand store writes are debounced (~1 s) to Firestore by `syncManager`. Never add manual `saveToFirestore()` calls, `localStorage`, or `useEffect` save timers — mutate the store and let the writer persist.
- **Dual backends.** External data → Vercel `/api/*`; payments / business logic → Firebase Cloud Functions (via the Firebase SDK). Don't mix them.
